        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " sink time into: full proofs of the policy gradient theorem, measure-theoretic probability, the PPO trust-region/TRPO derivation with Fisher matrices, or convergence guarantees. Knowing they exist is enough. Interviewers for developer-leaning roles test whether you can reason about and implement these, not whether you can rederive them on a board.",
          "styles": {}
        }
